>My favorite color

Your memo noted that you already knew that.  Very good, since it will
help you get past the guy on the bridge.  Be ready for questions like
"What is the capital of Assyria?"

>The color of the dongle

Well, that depends on the dongle's alignment.  If it is lawful, it
might be white.  If it is chaotic, it might be black.  The best thing
to do would be to actually look for one, and then see what color it is.

>When I give it random garbage, Buford Frink shows up with the Sword of
>Software Protection and decapitates me.  Then the ice monster comes back
>to finish me off...

If you don't have the real manual for your computer game, it sounds
like you copied or pirated it from someone else.  Check with them to
see what they have.  Otherwise, go to the nearest software store to
wee if its for sale.  (If nothing else, having your own purchased
version not only gives you the manual, but makes you eligible for
game upgrades, bug fixes, game warranty, etc.)

Also, make sure you read enough of a newsgroup to understand what
it is about, before you post to it.

